    "body": "## `Fixes #3746` closes an issue whose pin is not met\n\nThe review found that the pin of #3746, `start_side_entries_have_no_helix_or_ramp`, is not met on this head. `crates/motion/src/machining2d/air_entry.rs:233-243` uses named helix and ramp stand-ins, and the change defers that work to #3748.\n\nThe commits say `Refs #3746`. Only the PR body says `Fixes #3746`. A merge closes #3746.\n\nDo one of these before the merge:\n1. change the body line to `Refs #3746` (or `Fixes #3748` when that PR lands), or\n2. update the pin of #3746 to the behaviour that this head gives, and say so on the issue.\n\nThe rest of the review is `merge-ready`. The other three notes are not blocking.\n",
