    "body": "## Pin 5 of #3746 is a done-criterion, and the body still closes the issue\n\n#3746 lists five pins under \"Done means: the five pins are green\". Pin 5 is `start_side_entries_have_no_helix_or_ramp`.\n\nOn this head the property of pin 5 is not met. `crates/motion/src/machining2d/air_entry.rs:233-243` emits named helix and ramp stand-ins, and the work moves to #3748.\n\nLine 47 of the body says `Fixes #3746`. A merge closes #3746 with pin 5 open.\n\nThe rule is one body line: a partial change says `Refs #N` (#3684). Please change line 47 to `Refs #3746` before the merge.\n\nIf the merge lands with line 47 as it is, I reopen #3746 with this comment as the record.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
